{{!-- META {"path":"tabs","title":"Tabs","description":"Content panels behind an accessible tablist. You write the panels; the runtime builds the tab buttons, the ARIA roles and arrow-key navigation, and without JavaScript every panel stays readable.","parent":"showcase","order":3,"data":{"icon":"tabs","preset":"corner-mesh"}} --}}
{{> page-hero parent=page.parent}}

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">01 · The defaults</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="t1_title">Write panels. Get tabs.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="t1_lead">Each panel's <code class="font-code text-base">data-sw-title</code> becomes its tab. For a label with an icon, add a <code class="font-code text-base">tabtitle</code> child; the runtime moves it into the button. Labels are per panel, so rich and plain tabs mix. Click a tab, or focus one and use the arrow keys, Home and End.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6">

<div data-sw-component="tabs">
  <div data-sw-part="panel" data-sw-title="Developers">
    <span data-sw-part="tabtitle">{{sw-icon "code" "h-4 w-4"}} Developers</span>
    <p class="pt-4 leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Write pages in Handlebars, HTML and Tailwind, in a code editor with a live preview.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-sw-part="panel" data-sw-title="Clients">
    <span data-sw-part="tabtitle">{{sw-icon "cursor-text" "h-4 w-4"}} Clients</span>
    <p class="pt-4 leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Click a heading on the live preview and type. The layout is not theirs to break.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-sw-part="panel" data-sw-title="Agents">
    <p class="pt-4 leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Connect Claude or another agent to the MCP endpoint and let it build pages with the same permissions as a person.</p>
  </div>
</div>

    </div>
    <div class="min-w-0">
