<section class="border-y border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">02 · Style the bar</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="t2_title">A panel holds any markup.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="t2_lead">Write the <code class="font-code text-base">tablist</code> part yourself only when you want to style the bar, here as a segmented track. The runtime still fills it, and the selector pill still glides to the active tab. Each panel fades in when it opens.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10">

