<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">03 · Vertical</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="t3_title">Tabs down the side.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="t3_lead">The runtime places the tablist beside the panels as their sibling, so a grid on the root makes it vertical: the tablist takes the first column and every panel shares the second.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6">

