  <div data-sw-part="tablist" class="flex gap-1"></div>
  <div data-sw-part="panel" data-sw-title="Local Hosting">
    <p class="leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Served by the instance itself, at a subdomain of your sites domain or under a path, with custom domains verified by a TXT record.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-sw-part="panel" data-sw-title="SFTP">
    <p class="leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">A password or an SSH key, with host-key pinning, and fast paths over rsync or tar through SSH.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-sw-part="panel" data-sw-title="Git">
    <p class="leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Each deploy is one fresh commit, force-pushed to the branch you name.</p>
  </div>
</div>

  </div>
